nth":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1045","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,82,41,2,30,35],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1000205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1032","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[70,82,41,2,30,35],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1000205"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10149","city":"CS1045","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[70,82,41,2,30,35],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"99","reputation":"300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1000205"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"张绣武将，有着身负重物亦可日行七百里的气力。张绣第一次投降时，曹操因欣赏其骁健亲手赐金，反令张绣怀疑曹操欲收买亲信行刺，最终促成叛乱爆发。张绣欲反叛曹操时，令胡车儿灌醉曹操护卫典韦，并盗走其镔铁双戟，使典韦后续作战中陷入苦战并战死。后在长坂坡一战中合力围攻赵云，被赵云刺死。","tc":"張繡武將，有著身負重物亦可日行七百里的氣力。張繡第一次投降時，曹操因欣賞其驍健親手賜金，反令張繡懷疑曹操欲收買親信行刺，最終促成叛亂爆發。張繡欲反叛曹操時，令胡車兒灌醉曹操護衛典韋，并盜走其鑌鐵雙戟，使典韋后續作戰中陷入苦戰并戰死。后在長坂坡一戰中合力圍攻趙云，被趙云刺死。","en":"An officer under Zhang Xiu, possessed of such prodigious strength that he could march seven hundred li in a day even while carrying heavy loads. When Zhang Xiu first surrendered, Cao Cao was so impressed by Hu Che'er's prowess that he personally rewarded him with gold, arousing Zhang Xiu's suspicion that Cao Cao intended to buy his men's loyalty for an assassination, which ultimately triggered the rebellion. When Zhang Xiu turned against Cao Cao, he ordered Hu Che'er to get Cao Cao's bodyguard Dian Wei drunk and steal his twin iron halberds, leaving Dian Wei to struggle desperately in the ensuing battle before dying in action. He was later killed by Zhao Yun during the Battle of Changban after joining in the encirclement against him.","jp":"張繍配下の武将。重荷を背負いながらも日に七百里を行く膂力の持ち主。張繍が最初に降伏した際、曹操はその驍勇を愛でて親ら黄金を下賜したが、張繍は曹操が自分の側近を買収して自分を暗殺しようとしていると疑い、結果として叛乱を誘発することとなった。張繍が曹操への反逆を企てた際には、曹操の護衛である典韋を酒に酔わせてその鑌鉄双戟を盗み出し、典韋をその後の戦いで苦戦の末に戦死させた。後に長坂の戦いにおいて他の将と合力して趙雲を包囲攻撃するも、趙雲に刺し殺された。","kr":"장수 휘하의 무장으로, 무거운 짐을 지고도 하루에 700리를 갈 수 있는 기력을 지녔다. 장수가 처음 항복했을 때, 조조가 그의 용맹하고 날랜 면모를 마음에 들어 하여 친히 황금을 하사했으나, 도리어 장수는 조조가 측근을 매수해 자신을 암살하려는 것이 아닌가 의심하였고 결국 반란을 일으키는 계기가 되었다. 장수가 조조에게 반기를 들려 할 때 호거아를 시켜 조조의 호위인 전위를 만취하게 만든 뒤 그의 빈철쌍극을 훔쳐냈으며, 이로 인해 전위는 뒤이은 전투에서 고전 끝에 전사하였다. 훗날 장판파 전투에서 힘을 합쳐 조운을 포위 공격했으나, 도리어 조운의 창에 찔려 죽었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10148","remark":"","surname":"胡","surnameTc":"胡","surnameEn":"Hu","surnameJp":"胡","surnameKr":"호","surnameOther":"","name":"车儿","nameTc":"車兒","nameEn":"Che-er","nameJp":"車児","nameKr":"거아","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"胡车儿","power":"WJ10048","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"188","city":"CS1032","gender":"0","rule":"70","force":"82","wise":"41","politics":"2","charm":"30","will":"35","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"11","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"2","willTalent":"2","weaponMaster":"24/81/24/24/24/10/50/24","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1003402;1004400","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1002305","battleSoul":"1011605","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4900","battleSoulPoint":"6700","debateSoulPoint":"1600","strategy":"1003508","strategy2":"1008501","professions":"2/0/2/0/0/0/2/0/0/0/2/3/3/0/3/0/0/0/0/1/0/3/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"98","loyalty":"99","reputation":"300","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"7","birth":"164","show":"184","death":"208","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcN